# Force LF line endings for everything in the repository — the production
# target is Linux (Docker on the VPS), and Node/webpack/prisma tooling all
# assume LF. Windows contributors get CRLF in their working tree only if
# they've set `core.autocrlf=true`; the committed blob is always LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Preserve platform-native endings for scripts that only run on Windows.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary content — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
